Z||000007||Oreif||08-06-2001||01:17 AM||||Not shy Just being nice and not hounding new members.... Yet.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>But if interested, Go to:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/purplehazeracing/tabs.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/purplehazeracing/tabs.html</A> <P>As for "Hypetech tuning" It depends on the program. You need to find out if it is a stage I or stage II chip. You can crossreference the part number. Some require a low temp fan switch and thermostat.  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
